{"text":"purananuru","n":355,"lines":["தோற்றக் கிடையாத போயின செய்யுள் இது","மதிலும் ஞாயில் இன்றே கிடங்கும்","நீஇர் இன்மையின் கன்றுமேய்ந்து உகளும்","ஊரது நிலைமையும் இதுவே"],"tr":["tōṟṟak kiṭaiyāta pōyiṉa ceyyuḷ itu","matilum ñāyil iṉṟē kiṭaṅkum","nīir iṉmaiyiṉ kaṉṟumēyntu ukaḷum","ūratu nilaimaiyum ituvē"],"colophon":{"tinai":"kāñci","tinai_ta":"காஞ்சி","turai_ta":"பெயர் தெரிந்திலது","poet_ta":"பெயர் தெரிந்திலது","poet_tr":"Peyar Terintilatu"},"scan":{"meter":"nilaimaṇṭila āciriyappā","ok":true,"checks":[{"name":"lines","ok":true,"detail":"4 lines"},{"name":"feet per line","ok":true,"detail":"4×4 feet"},{"name":"foot types","ok":true,"detail":"iyaṟcīr 15, veṇcīr 1"},{"name":"linkage","ok":true,"detail":"veṇṭaḷai 7, āciriyattaḷai 7, kalittaḷai 1"},{"name":"ending","ok":true,"detail":"ends on ஏ"}],"ending":"ஏ","lines":[[{"text":"தோற்றக்","tr":"tōṟṟak","foot":"tēmā","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"தோற்","tr":"tōṟ"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"றக்","tr":"ṟak"}]},{"text":"கிடையா","tr":"kiṭaiyā","foot":"puḷimā","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"கிடை","tr":"kiṭai"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"யா","tr":"yā"}]},{"text":"தபோயின","tr":"tapōyiṉa","foot":"karuviḷam","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"தபோ","tr":"tapō"},{"kind":"nirai","text":"யின","tr":"yiṉa"}]},{"text":"செய்யுளிது","tr":"ceyyuḷitu","foot":"kūviḷaṅkāy","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"செய்","tr":"cey"},{"kind":"nirai","text":"யுளி","tr":"yuḷi"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"து","tr":"tu"}]}],[{"text":"மதிலும்","tr":"matilum","foot":"puḷimā","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"மதி","tr":"mati"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"லும்","tr":"lum"}]},{"text":"ஞாயி","tr":"ñāyi","foot":"tēmā","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"ஞா","tr":"ñā"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"யி","tr":"yi"}]},{"text":"லின்றே","tr":"liṉṟē","foot":"tēmā","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"லின்","tr":"liṉ"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"றே","tr":"ṟē"}]},{"text":"கிடங்கும்","tr":"kiṭaṅkum","foot":"puḷimā","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"கிடங்","tr":"kiṭaṅ"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"கும்","tr":"kum"}]}],[{"text":"நீஇரின்","tr":"nīiriṉ","foot":"kūviḷam","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"நீ","tr":"nī"},{"kind":"nirai","text":"இரின்","tr":"iriṉ"}]},{"text":"மையின்","tr":"maiyiṉ","foot":"tēmā","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"மை","tr":"mai"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"யின்","tr":"yiṉ"}]},{"text":"கன்றுமேய்ந்","tr":"kaṉṟumēyn","foot":"kūviḷam","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"கன்","tr":"kaṉ"},{"kind":"nirai","text":"றுமேய்ந்","tr":"ṟumēyn"}]},{"text":"துகளு","tr":"tukaḷu","foot":"puḷimā","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"துக","tr":"tuka"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"ளு","tr":"ḷu"}]}],[{"text":"மூர","tr":"mūra","foot":"tēmā","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"மூ","tr":"mū"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"ர","tr":"ra"}]},{"text":"துநிலை","tr":"tunilai","foot":"puḷimā","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"துநி","tr":"tuni"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"லை","tr":"lai"}]},{"text":"மையு","tr":"maiyu","foot":"tēmā","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"மை","tr":"mai"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"யு","tr":"yu"}]},{"text":"மிதுவே","tr":"mituvē","foot":"puḷimā","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"மிது","tr":"mitu"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"வே","tr":"vē"}]}]]},"ai":{"lines":[{"words":[{"surface":"தோற்றக்","parts":[{"text":"தோற்றக்","lemma":"தோற்றக்","gloss":"beginning"}],"gloss":"beginning","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"கிடையாத","parts":[{"text":"கிடை","lemma":"கிடை","gloss":"be obtained"},{"text":"ஆத","lemma":"ஆத","gloss":"which is not"}],"gloss":"which is not obtained"},{"surface":"போயின","parts":[{"text":"போ","lemma":"போ","gloss":"go"},{"text":"இன","lemma":"இன","gloss":"past neuter plural"}],"gloss":"which became"},{"surface":"செய்யுள்","parts":[{"text":"செய்யுள்","lemma":"செய்யுள்","gloss":"poem"}],"gloss":"poem"},{"surface":"இது","parts":[{"text":"இது","lemma":"இது","gloss":"this"}],"gloss":"this"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"மதிலும்","parts":[{"text":"மதில்","lemma":"மதில்","gloss":"wall"},{"text":"உம்","lemma":"உம்","gloss":"and"}],"gloss":"and the wall"},{"surface":"ஞாயில்","parts":[{"text":"ஞாயில்","lemma":"ஞாயில்","gloss":"bastion"}],"gloss":"bastion"},{"surface":"இன்றே","parts":[{"text":"இன்று","lemma":"இன்று","gloss":"is not"},{"text":"ஏ","lemma":"ஏ","gloss":"indeed"}],"gloss":"is indeed without"},{"surface":"கிடங்கும்","parts":[{"text":"கிடங்கு","lemma":"கிடங்கு","gloss":"moat"},{"text":"உம்","lemma":"உம்","gloss":"and"}],"gloss":"and the moat"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"நீஇர்","parts":[{"text":"நீஇர்","lemma":"நீஇர்","gloss":"water"}],"gloss":"water","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"இன்மையின்","parts":[{"text":"இன்மை","lemma":"இன்மை","gloss":"absence"},{"text":"இன்","lemma":"இன்","gloss":"because of"}],"gloss":"because of the absence"},{"surface":"கன்று","parts":[{"text":"கன்று","lemma":"கன்று","gloss":"calf"}],"gloss":"calf"},{"surface":"மேய்ந்து","parts":[{"text":"மேய்ந்து","lemma":"மேய்ந்து","gloss":"having grazed"}],"gloss":"having grazed","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"உகளும்","parts":[{"text":"உகள்","lemma":"உகள்","gloss":"frisk"},{"text":"உம்","lemma":"உம்","gloss":"will"}],"gloss":"will frisk"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"ஊரது","parts":[{"text":"ஊர்","lemma":"ஊர்","gloss":"town"},{"text":"அது","lemma":"அது","gloss":"of"}],"gloss":"of the town"},{"surface":"நிலைமையும்","parts":[{"text":"நிலைமை","lemma":"நிலைமை","gloss":"state"},{"text":"உம்","lemma":"உம்","gloss":"and"}],"gloss":"and the state"},{"surface":"இதுவே","parts":[{"text":"இது","lemma":"இது","gloss":"this"},{"text":"ஏ","lemma":"ஏ","gloss":"indeed"}],"gloss":"is indeed this"}]}],"literal":"This is a poem whose beginning is not obtained. / The wall is indeed without bastions, and the moat, / because of the absence of water, is where calves graze and frisk. / And the state of the town is indeed this.","translation":"This is a poem whose beginning is lost. The fortress wall has no bastions now. And in the dry moat, empty of water, calves graze and frisk about. Such indeed is the state of this town.","modern":"தொடக்கப் பகுதி கிடைக்காமல் போன செய்யுள் இது. மதிலில் இப்போது காவல் மாடங்கள் இல்லை. அகழியோ, நீர் இல்லாததால், கன்றுகள் மேய்ந்து துள்ளி விளையாடும் இடமாகிவிட்டது. இந்த ஊரின் நிலையும் இப்போது இதுவே ஆகும்.","explanation":"This is a fragmentary poem from the Purananuru collection, categorized under the theme of Kāñci, which deals with the transience and instability of the world. The poet, whose name is lost, describes the ruined state of a once-glorious fort and town. The defensive walls no longer have bastions, and the deep moat, which once held protective water, is now dry and serves merely as a pasture where calves graze and play. This stark transition from a formidable military defense system to a dry playground for domestic animals emphasizes the theme of decay and impermanence. Key words include 'ஞாயில்' (bastion), 'கிடங்கு' (moat), 'நீர் இன்மையின்' (due to lack of water), and 'ஊரது நிலைமை' (the state of the town).","model":"gemini-3.5-flash"}}